### Naming Convention Quick Reference

| Type | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Service ID | `{name}` (kebab-case) | `order-service` |
| Event name | `{entity}-{action}` | `order-created` |
| Event type | `com.{context}.{entity}-{action}` | `com.orders.order-created` |
| Command class | `Create{Entity}Request` | `CreateOrderRequest` |
| Event class | `{Entity}{Action}Event` | `OrderCreatedEvent` |
| Controller | `{Entity}Controller` | `OrderController` |
| Service | `{Entity}Service` | `OrderService` |
| Repository | `{Entity}Repository` | `OrderRepository` |
| Schema file | `{entity}-{purpose}.json` | `order-created.json` |

---
